Changes:
 linuxmuster-base7 (7.3.40-0) lmn73; urgency=low
 .
   * fix(linuxmuster-release-upgrade): retrofit quota fstab fix and unit
     masking onto upgraded systems, since neither lmn-prepare nor
     e_fstab.py ever touch them otherwise (0d56f33, 50eb82d).
   * fix(linuxmuster-release-upgrade): purge modemmanager before the OS
     upgrade, if installed - useless here and slows the upgrade down
     (7296d9e).
